# game/week7.rpy:8
translate indonesian week7_start_577c1631:

    # n "Soft morning light spilled across rows of empty seats, and the low hum of desktop fans blended with the faint tapping of keys."
    n  "Sinar lembut mentari pagi menyinari deretan bangku kelas yang masih lengang, berpadu dengan dengung kipas desktop PC dan ketukan halus tuts papan ketik."

# game/week7.rpy:9
translate indonesian week7_start_82dd7a69:

    # n "In the far corner, Trida sat at their usual desk with their shoulders hunched over their heavy laptop."
    n  "Di sudut belakang ruangan, Trida duduk di bangku biasanya dengan bahu agak membungkuk di depan laptopnya yang tebal."

# game/week7.rpy:10
translate indonesian week7_start_2069232d:

    # n "Their eyes moved quickly over the screen, completely focused on a half-finished animation."
    n  "Sorot matanya bergerak lincah menyapu layar, terfokus sepenuhnya pada potongan animasi yang baru setengah jadi."

# game/week7.rpy:11
translate indonesian week7_start_2e4c0cdf:

    # n "They looked so absorbed in Maya, their world shrinking down to the glowing monitor and the quiet rhythm of their work, exactly as people imagine animation students to be."
    n  "Ia tampak begitu tenggelam dalam Maya; dunianya menyusut hanya sebatas pendar monitor dan ketukan ritmis pengerjaan tugasnya, persis seperti bayangan orang tentang anak animasi sejati."

# game/week7.rpy:13
translate indonesian week7_start_04c468a3:

    # n "In one hand, their fingers absentmindedly turned over a slightly crumpled, half-eaten bar of chocolate."
    n  "Di salah satu tangannya, jemarinya tanpa sadar membolak-balik sebatang cokelat yang sudah agak lecek dan baru dimakan setengah."

# game/week7.rpy:14
translate indonesian week7_start_f7fd6055:

    # n "It was the same specialty snack you gave them yesterday."
    n  "Itu adalah camilan spesial yang kamu berikan padanya kemarin."

# game/week7.rpy:15
translate indonesian week7_start_4d4d153a:

    # n "That day had been so tense your stomach felt like it was in knots, and your heartbeat and breath kept catching."
    n  "Kemarin rasanya begitu tegang hingga perutmu mulas bagai terikat simpul, dan detak jantung serta tarikan napasmu kerap tertahan."

# game/week7.rpy:17
translate indonesian week7_start_18855830:

    # n "You walked up to them, stepping quietly before leaning your weight against the edge of their desk."
    n  "Kamu melangkah menghampirinya tanpa suara sebelum menyandarkan tubuhmu di tepian mejanya."

# game/week7.rpy:19
translate indonesian week7_start_6214ee79:

    # p "You're seriously still eating that?"
    p  "Kamu beneran masih makan cokelat itu?"

# game/week7.rpy:21
translate indonesian week7_start_35300041:

    # n "You crossed your arms with a small smirk of morning greetings, with just a pinch of teasing."
    n  "Kamu melipat kedua tangan di dada dengan senyuman tipis khas sapaan pagi, diiringi secuil nada menggoda."

# game/week7.rpy:22
translate indonesian week7_start_54d6e39a:

    # p "I bet it's been sitting in your bag since yesterday."
    p  "Pasti dari kemarin cokelat itu cuma kamu diemin di dalam tas kan?"

# game/week7.rpy:25
translate indonesian week7_start_f7987bcb:

    # n "Trida jerked upright in their chair, their whole body giving a startled twitch as your voice cut through their focus."
    n  "Trida tersentak tegak di kursinya, sekujur tubuhnya terlonjak kaget saat suaramu membelah konsentrasinya."

# game/week7.rpy:26
translate indonesian week7_start_63754176:

    # n "Their eyes widened, and a bright red flush crept up from their neck to the tips of their ears."
    n  "Matanya membelalak lebar, dan rona merah padam seketika merambat naik dari leher hingga ke ujung daun telinganya."

# game/week7.rpy:27
translate indonesian week7_start_d007c260:

    # n "They fumbled with the chocolate bar, nearly dropping it, before letting out a loud, high-pitched laugh."
    n  "Jemarinya gelagapan memegang cokelat itu sampai hampir terjatuh, sebelum akhirnya ia melepaskan tawa riang bernada tinggi."

# game/week7.rpy:28
translate indonesian week7_start_b1e86959:

    # n "Their fingers drummed anxiously against the desk, trying to hide their reaction behind a burst of panic."
    n  "Jari-jemarinya mengetuk-ngetuk meja dengan cemas, berusaha menutupi rasa salah tingkahnya di balik ledakan panik yang dibuat-buat."

# game/week7.rpy:30
translate indonesian week7_start_944740b8:

    # trida "E-eh?! What do you mean?!"
    trida  "E—eh?! Maksudmu gimana coba?!"

# game/week7.rpy:31
translate indonesian week7_start_b6151a9a:

    # trida "Good food has its own timeline, okay! It's called savoring, look it up!"
    trida  "Makanan enak itu punya waktunya sendiri tahu! Namanya juga dinikmati pelan-pelan, cari tahu sana!"

# game/week7.rpy:32
translate indonesian week7_start_ec134305:

    # n "They gestured wildly with the half-eaten chocolate bar, nearly dropping it onto their keyboard."
    n  "Ia menggerakkan tangannya heboh sambil memegang cokelat yang tinggal setengah itu, sampai-sampai hampir menjatuhkannya ke atas keyboard."

# game/week7.rpy:33
translate indonesian week7_start_c07fc95b:

    # trida "Besides, it's not like it went bad or anything!"
    trida  "Lagian cokelatnya belum basi juga kok!"

# game/week7.rpy:35
translate indonesian week7_start_b14c5b96:

    # n "You let out a soft chuckle, watching them scramble to defend their snacking habits."
    n  "Kamu tertawa kecil, geli melihat tingkahnya yang kalang kabut membela kebiasaan makannya."

# game/week7.rpy:36
translate indonesian week7_start_7d0ea2bb:

    # p "Sure, keep telling yourself that. Don't come crying to me if your stomach starts acting up during third period."
    p  "Iya deh, terserah apa katamu. Jangan nangis ngadu ke aku ya kalau perutmu melilit pas jam pelajaran ketiga nanti."

# game/week7.rpy:39
translate indonesian week7_start_6d6def6c:

    # n "Trida grinned, the nervous tension instantly draining from their shoulders as they settled back into their chair."
    n  "Trida tersenyum lebar, ketegangan yang tadi sempat kaku seketika luruh dari pundaknya saat ia kembali bersandar rileks di kursi."

# game/week7.rpy:40
translate indonesian week7_start_129a1d44:

    # n "They reached out, giving your arm a quick, familiar nudge with their elbow—that subconscious physical touch they always did without realizing it."
    n  "Ia mengulurkan tangan, menyenggol pelan lenganmu dengan sikunya—kebiasaan sentuhan fisik akrab yang selalu ia lakukan tanpa sadar."

# game/week7.rpy:41
translate indonesian week7_start_6f8c69b3:

    # trida "Jeez, look at you, acting all worried. Who knew you cared so much about my digestive health?"
    trida  "Dih, lihat deh gayamu, sok-sokan khawatir gitu. Sejak kapan kamu peduli amat sama kesehatan pencernaanku?"

# game/week7.rpy:43
translate indonesian week7_start_b6682848:

    # n "They laughed dryly, but their gaze suddenly shifted, bouncing nervously toward the edge of the desk before locking back onto yours."
    n  "Ia tertawa renyah, namun tatapannya mendadak bergeser, melirik kikuk ke tepian meja sebelum kembali menatap matamu."

# game/week7.rpy:44
translate indonesian week7_start_4fbe6817:

    # n "The bright cadence in their voice faltered and was replaced by a strange hesitation."
    n  "Nada bicaranya yang ceria mendadak terhenti, berganti keraguan yang aneh."

# game/week7.rpy:45
translate indonesian week7_start_12bcee0a:

    # n "They cleared their throat, and you suddenly found their half-eaten chocolate bar very, very interesting to look at."
    n  "Ia berdeham pelan, dan mendadak cokelat setengah gigitan itu terlihat menjadi objek yang amat sangat menarik untuk dipandangi."

# game/week7.rpy:47
translate indonesian week7_start_504d1d50:

    # trida "Um... actually..."
    trida  "Um... sebenarnya..."

# game/week7.rpy:48
translate indonesian week7_start_2676a751:

    # n "Their voice dropped an octave, turning much quieter, stripped of its usual performative silliness."
    n  "Nada suaranya merendah satu oktaf, terdengar jauh lebih lirih, tanpa ada sisa tingkah konyolnya yang biasanya."

# game/week7.rpy:50
translate indonesian week7_start_88b9f210:

    # n "They rubbed the back of their neck with their free hand, their fingers fidgeting nervously against their collar."
    n  "Ia mengusap tengkuknya dengan tangan yang bebas, jemarinya meremas kerah bajunya dengan canggung."

# game/week7.rpy:51
translate indonesian week7_start_ae54a02f:

    # trida "The truth is... I was saving it on purpose."
    trida  "Sebenarnya... aku sengaja nyimpan cokelat ini."

# game/week7.rpy:53
translate indonesian week7_start_4b43ea2e:

    # n "You blinked, caught off guard by the sudden shift in tone."
    n  "Kamu mengerjap, terkejut mendengar perubahan nada bicaranya yang tiba-tiba begitu serius."

# game/week7.rpy:54
translate indonesian week7_start_991efb4c:

    # p "Saving it?"
    p  "Sengaja disimpan?"

# game/week7.rpy:55
translate indonesian week7_start_aaf28a93:

    # p "Why? It's just regular chocolate."
    p  "Kenapa? Kan cuma cokelat biasa."

# game/week7.rpy:57
translate indonesian week7_start_4b490368:

    # n "Trida's eyes darted up to meet yours, maintaining that intense, unblinking eye contact they always held when trying desperately to be sincere."
    n  "Mata Trida mendongak menatap matamu, mempertahankan tatapan lekat tanpa berkedip yang selalu ia tunjukkan tiap kali berusaha jujur dari lubuk hatinya."

# game/week7.rpy:58
translate indonesian week7_start_ba0eabbf:

    # n "Their ears were bright red now."
    n  "Daun telinganya kini merona merah terang."

# game/week7.rpy:59
translate indonesian week7_start_430177d8:

    # trida "It's not 'just' anything when it was... you know. Given by you."
    trida  "Nggak ada yang namanya 'cuma biasa' kalau cokelat itu... kamu tahu kan. Kamu yang ngasih."

# game/week7.rpy:61
translate indonesian week7_start_c44a40fa:

    # n "They let out a dry, self-deprecating chuckle, their gaze dropping back to the desk as they tried to laugh it off."
    n  "Ia tertawa kecil mencela dirinya sendiri, pandangannya kembali menunduk ke meja berusaha menepis rasa canggung."

# game/week7.rpy:62
translate indonesian week7_start_1f745715:

    # trida "Listen to me, ugh... I sound so cheesy right now. Ignore me."
    trida  "Dengerin deh omonganku, ugh... kedengerannya geli dan lebay banget ya. Udah, lupain aja."

# game/week7.rpy:64
translate indonesian week7_start_56d82d92:

    # n "They tried to look away, but you didn't move, and they kept rushing their words as if trying to outrun their own vulnerability."
    n  "Ia mencoba memalingkan wajah, namun kamu tetap bergeming di tempatmu, dan ia terus berbicara terburu-buru seakan ingin lari dari kerentanan hatinya sendiri."

# game/week7.rpy:65
translate indonesian week7_start_88ec4b4f:

    # trida "No, but seriously—I don't get stuff like that very often. Nobody really just... hands me something nice out of nowhere before."
    trida  "Nggak, tapi serius deh—aku jarang banget dapet perlakuan kayak gitu. Sebelumnya nggak pernah ada orang yang... tiba-tiba ngasih sesuatu yang manis begini tanpa ada maunya."

# game/week7.rpy:66
translate indonesian week7_start_f545c856:

    # trida "It genuinely made my whole week better, okay?"
    trida  "Pemberianmu kemarin bener-bener bikin semingguku jadi jauh lebih indah, tahu nggak?"

# game/week7.rpy:68
translate indonesian week7_start_dcd4c348:

    # n "For a second, the bustling noise of the classroom around you seemed to fade away entirely."
    n  "Untuk sesaat, keriuhan obrolan anak-anak di kelas seolah senyap sepenuhnya."

# game/week7.rpy:69
translate indonesian week7_start_bccc36e8:

    # n "The raw, unguarded honesty caught you completely off guard."
    n  "Kejujuran polos tanpa pertahanan itu benar-benar membuatmu terperangah tak menduga."

# game/week7.rpy:70
translate indonesian week7_start_8f629e0d:

    # trida "It made me feel like... maybe I'm not totally invisible here."
    trida  "Hal itu bikin aku ngerasa... mungkin selama ini aku nggak sepenuhnya nggak dianggap di sini."

# game/week7.rpy:72
translate indonesian week7_start_16fdc214:

    # n "You stood there, suddenly struggling to find a casual reply, feeling a hot flush creep up your own neck as you stared back at them."
    n  "Kamu terpaku berdiri di sana, mendadak kelu mencari kata-kata santai untuk membalasnya, merasakan sengatan hangat yang menjalar naik ke lehermu saat balik menatapnya."

# game/week7.rpy:73
translate indonesian week7_start_f2f5f9eb:

    # n "Trida noticed your silence, and their eyes widened in mild panic, their hands immediately flying to their pockets as if wanting to disappear into their chair."
    n  "Menyadari keheninganmu, mata Trida membelalak panik; kedua tangannya buru-buru ia sembunyikan ke dalam saku hoodie seolah ingin menghilang ditelan kursinya."

# game/week7.rpy:74
translate indonesian week7_start_b371cce5:

    # trida "A-anyway! Back to work, right? Before the teacher explains another thing!"
    trida  "P—pokoknya gitu deh! Balik nugas lagi yuk! Nanti keburu gurunya masuk dan nerangin materi baru!"

# game/week7.rpy:75
translate indonesian week7_start_8fe9f9dd:

    # trida "Can't have us failing, can we?"
    trida  "Kita kan nggak mau sampai nggak lulus, ya nggak?"

# game/week7.rpy:79
translate indonesian week7_start_8226fce4:

    # p "Right..."
    p  "Iya juga sih..."

# game/week7.rpy:82
translate indonesian week7_start_14795677:

    # p "Obviously not."
    p  "Jelas nggak lah."

# game/week7.rpy:84
translate indonesian week7_start_67e6ab83:

    # p "Of course, we don't."
    p  "Tentu aja nggak."

# game/week7.rpy:99
translate indonesian week7_break_time_d505703a:

    # n "You can't focus the whole time in class, the voice of the teacher passing by like a buzzing sound through your head."
    n  "Sepanjang jam pelajaran kamu sama sekali tidak bisa fokus; suara penjelasan guru di depan kelas hanya berlalu bagai dengung lebah di kepalamu."

# game/week7.rpy:100
translate indonesian week7_break_time_2003b661:

    # n "You kept stealing glances at Trida's desk, where that chocolate belongs."
    n  "Pandanganmu berulang kali mencuri lirik ke meja Trida, tempat cokelat itu berada."

# game/week7.rpy:101
translate indonesian week7_break_time_8f9f65ab:

    # n "Before you realized, the speaker was already announcing break time, snapping you out of your thoughts."
    n  "Tanpa kamu sadari, pengeras suara sekolah sudah mengumandangkan bel istirahat, membuyarkan seluruh lamunanmu."

# game/week7.rpy:102
translate indonesian week7_break_time_9466e524:

    # p "I probably need to just forget this. I need to enjoy the break time..."
    p  "Mending lupain dulu soal itu deh. Mumpung lagi istirahat, mending nikmatin waktu luang..."

# game/week7.rpy:103
translate indonesian week7_break_time_1512f66c:

    # p "Where should I go now?"
    p  "Ke mana ya enaknya sekarang?"

# game/week7.rpy:117
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_189d035c:

    # n "The Grapos field outside hummed with life, a vibrant tapestry of students stretching their limbs and leaning against the weathered concrete pillars, savoring the brief yet precious respite from their hectic schedules."
    n  "Lapangan Grapos di luar berdenyut penuh kehidupan, hamparan siswa-siswi yang meregangkan otot dan bersandar di pilar-pilar semen tua, menikmati jeda singkat yang berharga dari padatnya jadwal mereka."

# game/week7.rpy:118
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_bb283ba3:

    # n "Clusters of them flocked to the canteen, drawn in like moths to a flickering flame, their laughter and chatter creating a symphony of youthful exuberance."
    n  "Gerombolan siswa berbondong-bondong menuju kantin bagai laron yang tertarik pada nyala lentera, tawa canda mereka menciptakan simfoni riuh khas anak muda."

# game/week7.rpy:119
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_4214ed13:

    # n "The warm midday air enveloped you, infused with the faint aroma of food and the distant murmur of vocational students animatedly discussing render queues and impending project deadlines."
    n  "Udara siang yang hangat menyelimutimu, berpadu dengan aroma sedap makanan dan sayup-sayup celotehan siswa SMK animasi yang heboh membahas antrean render dan tenggat projek yang kian mencekik."

# game/week7.rpy:120
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_1f352a4f:

    # n "You found yourself leaning against the cool concrete railing, relishing the quiet reprieve, the bustle around you fading into a soft background hum."
    n  "Kamu menyandarkan tubuh di pagar semen yang sejuk, menikmati kelegaan jeda istirahat saat hiruk-pikuk di sekelilingmu perlahan memudar menjadi dengungan latar yang lembut."

# game/week7.rpy:122
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_c6ed7651:

    # n "Suddenly, you noticed footsteps padding softly against the pavement nearby."
    n  "Tiba-tiba, suara derap langkah pelan terdengar mendekat di atas paving."

# game/week7.rpy:124
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_f3cb1043:

    # n "Radit appeared, his easy-going demeanor evident as he sauntered over, hands tucked deep into the pockets of his jacket."
    n  "Radit muncul dengan gaya santainya yang khas, berjalan menghampirimu dengan kedua tangan terbenam di saku jaket."

# game/week7.rpy:125
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_4774ac89:

    # n "With a gentle shake of his head, he cast off the last remnants of moisture from his hurried trip to the washroom."
    n  "Sambil menggelengkan kepalanya pelan, ia mengibaskan sisa-sisa tetesan air dari wajahnya setelah buru-buru membasuh muka di toilet."

# game/week7.rpy:127
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_1ffc5f26:

    # radit "Man... sometimes I think about dropping out to become a professional sleeper."
    radit  "Duh gila... kadang aku kepikiran pengin drop out aja terus daftar jadi atlet tidur profesional."

# game/week7.rpy:128
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_f0aafaae:

    # n "Radit spoke softly, his words drawn out as he slipped into his signature easygoing rhythm."
    n  "Radit berbicara dengan nada santai dan pelan, mengalun lembut mengikuti ritme pembawaannya yang tenang tanpa beban."

# game/week7.rpy:129
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_542f6922:

    # n "After a moment of deep contemplation, he let the silence linger before continuing, his tone languid and unhurried, as if savoring each syllable."
    n  "Setelah merenung sejenak, ia membiarkan keheningan menggantung sebelum melanjutkan kembali ucapannya yang lambat dan tanpa beban, seakan menikmati tiap silabel katanya."

# game/week7.rpy:130
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_0275c83d:

    # radit "My bed's calling me from across town, I swear."
    radit  "Rasanya kasur di kosanku dari tadi manggil-manggil namaku terus tuh."

# game/week7.rpy:132
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_9c358198:

    # n "You let out a soft huff of laughter, glancing sideways at him."
    n  "Kamu tertawa geli sambil melirik ke arahnya dari samping."

# game/week7.rpy:133
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_5575d3f8:

    # p "Your bed is a mattress on the floor in a cramped boarding room, Radit. It's not calling you, it's begging for mercy."
    p  "Kasurmu itu cuma kasur busa tipis di lantai kamar kos yang sempit, Radit. Mana ada manggil-manggil, yang ada dia lagi minta ampun ditindih terus."

# game/week7.rpy:135
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_ef0d2cf4:

    # radit "True. But at least my mattress doesn't crash when I'm halfway through saving a file."
    radit  "Bener juga sih. Tapi seenggaknya kasurku nggak bakal pernah crash pas lagi asyik nge-save file."

# game/week7.rpy:137
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_2d7e2b41:

    # n "Radit gave a leisurely grin as his shoulders dropped with a laugh."
    n  "Radit menyunggingkan senyum malas seraya bahunya berguncang menahan tawa."

# game/week7.rpy:138
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_fcc3d8b5:

    # radit "Speaking of terrible life choices..."
    radit  "Ngomong-ngomong soal pilihan hidup yang salah..."

# game/week7.rpy:139
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_ff7e2d50:

    # n "He hesitated, transferring his weight to the opposite foot, his gaze wandering toward the horizon before returning to you with a wry sparkle in his eye."
    n  "Ia terdiam sejenak, memindahkan tumpuan berat badannya ke kaki yang lain, tatapannya menerawang ke cakrawala sebelum kembali menatapmu dengan kilau jenaka di matanya."

# game/week7.rpy:140
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_817425e0:

    # radit "I found this absolute trash-tier garage band from Shimokitazawa yesterday. Their entire aesthetic is just four guys standing in a dark basement playing out-of-tune guitars."
    radit  "Kemarin aku nggak sengaja nemu band garasi antah-berantah dari Shimokitazawa. Konsep estetikanya bener-bener cuma empat cowok berdiri di ruang bawah tanah gelap mainin gitar fals."

# game/week7.rpy:142
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_989e6b91:

    # p "And?"
    p  "Terus?"

# game/week7.rpy:143
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_b46aea08:

    # radit "And honestly? It's speaking to my soul."
    radit  "Terus... jujur aja? Musiknya bener-bener nyentuh jiwaku banget."

# game/week7.rpy:145
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_47461577:

    # n "You raised an eyebrow and then crossed your arms with a knowing smile."
    n  "Kamu mengangkat sebelah alis lalu melipat kedua tangan di dada dengan senyum penuh arti."

# game/week7.rpy:146
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_956d2d7b:

    # p "Let me guess. Another band with double-digit monthly listeners on Spotify, and you're about to spend half your allowance on an import vinyl that'll take three months to clear customs?"
    p  "Biar kutebak. Band lain lagi yang pendengar bulanannya di Spotify cuma dua digit, dan kamu udah siap ngabisin setengah uang saku bulananmu buat beli piringan hitam impor yang butuh tiga bulan buat lolos bea cukai?"

# game/week7.rpy:149
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_51ad82d0:

    # n "Radit just stared at you for a beat, with an amused twitch at the corner of his mouth."
    n  "Radit menatapmu beberapa detik tanpa berkedip, sudut bibirnya berkedut menahan tawa geli."

# game/week7.rpy:150
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_2d9948e4:

    # radit "First of all, it's a cassette tape, not a vinyl. Get your indie hipster formats right."
    radit  "Pertama-tama ya, itu kaset pita, bukan piringan hitam. Belajar dulu format rilisan anak indie sana."

# game/week7.rpy:151
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_352c41b1:

    # radit "Second is... wow, okay! Look at you, tracking my purchasing habits like an auditor."
    radit  "Kedua... wah gila ya! Kamu sampai hafal kebiasaan belanjaku kayak auditor keuangan aja."

# game/week7.rpy:152
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_f0247b1c:

    # n "He tilted his head, his hands staying firmly planted in his pockets as he leaned a shoulder against the railing next to you."
    n  "Ia memiringkan kepalanya sedikit, kedua tangannya tetap setia di dalam saku saat ia menyandarkan bahunya di sampingmu pada pagar pembatas."

# game/week7.rpy:153
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_18888f21:

    # radit "Should I be flattered that you remember what kind of garbage I waste my money on, or worried that you're turning into a stalker?"
    radit  "Kira-kira aku harus bangga karena kamu ingat sampah apa aja yang kubeli, atau harus waspada jangan-jangan kamu sekarang jadi stalker-ku nih?"

# game/week7.rpy:155
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_d6e930a7:

    # p "I don't need to stalk you when your room practically smells like shrink-wrapped album art and regret."
    p  "Ngapain juga aku nge-stalk kamu kalau aroma kamarmu aja udah jelas-jelas bau plastik sampul kaset sama penyesalan hidup."

# game/week7.rpy:156
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_21891730:

    # n "You retorted, nudging your elbow into Radit, who smirked with sincere warmth shining through his typical stoic demeanor, though he quickly masked it again with another casual jest."
    n  "Kamu membalas celotehannya sambil menyenggolkan siku ke lengan Radit. Radit tersenyum simpul dengan ketulusan hangat yang terpancar sekilas menembus tampang dinginnya, meski sedetik kemudian kembali ia tutupi dengan candaan santai."

# game/week7.rpy:159
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_77e8e5be:

    # radit "Hey, someone's gotta keep the local underground scene alive..."
    radit  "Ya gimana ya, harus ada yang rela berkorban demi ngehidupin skena musik bawah tanah lokal kan..."

# game/week7.rpy:160
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_1516fb74:

    # n "He glanced back toward the doorway of the classroom, catching a brief glimpse of the frantic energy still humming inside."
    n  "Ia melirik ke arah pintu kelas, menangkap sekilas energi kesibukan tugas yang masih berdenyut di dalam sana."

# game/week7.rpy:161
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_b2133628:

    # radit "Anyways, we should probably head back before the teacher locks us out and assumes we ran away to join an indie band ourselves."
    radit  "Udahlah, mending kita balik ke kelas sebelum pintunya dikunci guru dan kita disangka kabur buat bikin band indie sendiri."

# game/week7.rpy:162
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_493e4b9c:

    # radit "Though, honestly? Not the worst backup plan."
    radit  "Padahal kalau dipikir-pikir... bukan rencana cadangan yang buruk juga sih."

# game/week7.rpy:164
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_a49bd02f:

    # n "With an eased shrug, Radit pushed away from the railing, withdrawing one hand from his pocket briefly to point toward the door."
    n  "Dengan mengedikkan bahu santai, Radit menjauhkan tubuhnya dari pagar pembatas, menarik sebelah tangannya keluar dari saku untuk menunjuk ke arah pintu kelas."

# game/week7.rpy:165
translate indonesian week7_grapos_radit_e45b5cd1:

    # n "With an unhurried pace, the two of you turned and floated back into the classroom together."
    n  "Tanpa terburu-buru, kalian berdua berbalik dan melangkah santai kembali ke dalam kelas bersama-sama."

# game/week7.rpy:175
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_36533a62:

    # n "Instead of going outside in the sweltering midday heat or grabbing something from the canteen, you chose to stay in the quiet, air-conditioned classroom."
    n  "Ketimbang berpanas-panas di bawah terik hawa siang atau jajan ke kantin, kamu memilih tetap tinggal di ruang kelas yang sunyi dan ber-AC dingin."

# game/week7.rpy:176
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_dd2e0c3c:

    # n "You pulled an empty wooden chair over to Trida's desk."
    n  "Kamu menarik sebuah kursi kayu kosong ke samping meja Trida."

# game/week7.rpy:178
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_611a770b:

    # n "They stared blankly at an open notebook filled with chaotic character sketches and rough storyboard panels, lost in their thoughts."
    n  "Ia tampak terpaku memandangi buku catatannya yang terbuka, penuh coretan sketsa karakter dan draf papan cerita yang semrawut, larut dalam lamunannya."

# game/week7.rpy:180
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_2c068ab5:

    # p "If you keep staring at that paper, the ink is going to run away."
    p  "Kalau kamu pelototin terus kertasnya begitu, nanti tintanya bisa kabur ketakutan lho."

# game/week7.rpy:181
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_c9d979bd:

    # n "You said, resting your chin on your hand as you leaned against the edge of their desk."
    n  "Ucapmu seraya memangku dagu dengan tangan sambil bersandar di tepi mejanya."

# game/week7.rpy:184
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_8583d829:

    # n "Trida flinched, their pencil clattering onto the desk as they spun around in their chair."
    n  "Trida terlonjak kaget; pensilnya jatuh berdenting di atas meja saat ia buru-buru memutar kursinya ke arahmu."

# game/week7.rpy:185
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_16c16df7:

    # n "They let out a loud, high-pitched squawk and threw their hands up dramatically."
    n  "Ia memekik kaget bernada tinggi sambil mengangkat kedua tangannya dramatis ke udara."

# game/week7.rpy:186
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_ac994fbc:

    # trida "Oh, you're going to give me a heart attack!"
    trida  "Astagfirullah, kamu bikin jantungan aja deh!"

# game/week7.rpy:187
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_4a94017f:

    # trida "Don't sneak up on people like that when I'm trying to focus—or failing to focus!"
    trida  "Jangan suka ngagetin orang gitu napa kalau orang lagi berusaha fokus—atau tepatnya lagi gagal fokus!"

# game/week7.rpy:189
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_f2fa5d83:

    # n "They laughed nervously, their gaze darting around the empty room before landing on you with unblinking focus."
    n  "Ia tertawa panik, tatapannya menyapu sekeliling ruangan yang lengang sebelum kembali terpaku lurus menatapmu."

# game/week7.rpy:190
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_7684c0d6:

    # trida "Besides, the ink isn't running away because it's scared of me. It's running away because my layouts are a total disaster. Look at this nonsense."
    trida  "Lagian ya, tintanya kabur bukan gara-gara takut sama mukaku. Tapi gara-gara susunan layout-ku ini ancur lebur parah. Coba lihat coretan nggak jelas ini."

# game/week7.rpy:191
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_a80067b8:

    # n "They shoved the sketchbook closer to you, tapping aggressively on a messy sketch panel."
    n  "Ia menyodorkan buku sketsanya lebih dekat ke arahmu, mengetuk-ngetuk kasar salah satu panel yang masih berantakan."

# game/week7.rpy:192
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_da70df5b:

    # trida "I swear, every time I try to map out the pacing for this sequence, my brain just short circuits."
    trida  "Sumpah deh, tiap kali aku nyoba ngatur tempo buat adegan ini, otakku rasanya langsung korslet total."

# game/week7.rpy:193
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_eb7ffd1c:

    # trida "Why is structuring a story so hard? I just wanted to make something cool that made you feel like you could take on the world, but here I am making garbage."
    trida  "Kenapa sih bikin struktur cerita itu susah banget? Padahal niat awalnya cuma pengin bikin animasi keren yang bikin penonton ngerasa bisa naklukin dunia, tapi hasilnya malah sampah begini."

# game/week7.rpy:196
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_ad02660f:

    # n "They slumped forward, letting their forehead thump gently against the edge of the desk next to your arm, letting out a heavy sigh."
    n  "Ia menjatuhkan tubuhnya ke depan, membiarkan dahinya bersandar lemas di tepian meja tepat di samping lenganmu seraya menghembuskan napas putus asa."

# game/week7.rpy:197
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_80906fdb:

    # trida "Sometimes I wonder why I even try to aim high. Look at the other kids in our major—they're already creating amazing animation with gorgeous concepts, and here I am struggling to make a simple timeline make sense."
    trida  "Kadang aku mikir, ngapain juga ya aku pasang target ketinggian. Coba lihat anak-anak lain di jurusan kita—mereka udah bisa bikin animasi gila-gilaan dengan konsep luar biasa, sementara aku... bikin timeline sederhana aja masih megap-megap."

# game/week7.rpy:198
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_8f05179e:

    # trida "I kind of felt stupid, you know..."
    trida  "Rasanya aku bodoh banget, tahu nggak..."

# game/week7.rpy:200
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_ddc1ca09:

    # n "You chuckled and reached over to give their shoulder a comforting squeeze."
    n  "Kamu tersenyum hangat lalu mengulurkan tangan, memberikan remasan lembut yang menenangkan di pundaknya."

# game/week7.rpy:201
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_64e237ac:

    # p "You're too hard on yourself, Trida. You just need a break."
    p  "Kamu terlalu keras sama dirimu sendiri, Trida. Kamu cuma lagi butuh istirahat sejenak kok."

# game/week7.rpy:204
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_47283a0a:

    # n "At your warm touch, Trida perked up, a bright smile replacing their moment of doubt as if those heavy thoughts had vanished."
    n  "Merasakan sentuhan hangatmu, Trida langsung menegakkan badannya; senyuman cerah kembali merekah di wajahnya, seolah awan kelabu keraguannya tadi sirna seketika."

# game/week7.rpy:205
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_7e2c0ccb:

    # n "They leaned into your touch, bumping their shoulder against yours without realizing it."
    n  "Ia menyandarkan tubuhnya ke arah sentuhanmu, tanpa sadar menyentuhkan bahunya ke bahumu."

# game/week7.rpy:206
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_e5072644:

    # trida "See? That's why you're the best. Always showing up with the right words at the right time."
    trida  "Tuh kan! Itu kenapa kamu emang yang terbaik. Selalu aja hadir dengan kata-kata yang pas di saat yang tepat."

# game/week7.rpy:207
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_960cbdc0:

    # n "They laughed, their voice speeding up when they started talking animatedly again, gesturing wildly with their hands."
    n  "Ia tertawa riang, tempo bicaranya mendadak melesat cepat saat kembali berceloteh penuh semangat, tangannya bergerak ke sana-kemari."

# game/week7.rpy:209
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_3ad74df8:

    # trida "It's kind of out of nowhere, you know..."
    trida  "Mungkin agak random ya kedengarannya..."

# game/week7.rpy:210
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_60accd31:

    # trida "But did I tell you about the lore video I watched last night? It's this masterpiece of a classic RPG, and the plot twists just keep coming—?"
    trida  "Tapi aku udah pernah cerita belum soal video bedah lore yang kutonton semalam? Itu mahakarya RPG klasik yang luar biasa banget, plot twist-nya muncul terus tiada henti—?"

# game/week7.rpy:212
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_55dbc9d2:

    # n "They suddenly stopped, narrowing their eyes at you, though a pleased smile tugged at the corners of their mouth."
    n  "Ia mendadak berhenti, menyipitkan matanya menatapmu, meski seulas senyum puas tetap terkembang di sudut bibirnya."

# game/week7.rpy:213
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_a22512b8:

    # n "They noticed how close you were sitting and that you hadn't left for break like everyone else."
    n  "Ia baru tersadar betapa dekatnya kalian duduk berdua dan fakta bahwa kamu sama sekali tidak pergi keluar istirahat seperti anak-anak lainnya."

# game/week7.rpy:214
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_f721eb8b:

    # n "The tips of their ears turned a faint pink, and they quickly rubbed the back of their neck."
    n  "Ujung daun telinganya bersemu merah muda samar, dan ia buru-buru mengusap tengkuk lehernya yang canggung."

# game/week7.rpy:215
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_31d9b45d:

    # trida "Hold on, I just realized that you stayed inside during break?"
    trida  "Tunggu sebentar... baru nyadar, kamu beneran milih diam di dalam kelas pas jam istirahat gini?"

# game/week7.rpy:217
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_c9d4d013:

    # p "Yeah, well... Do you have any problems with that?"
    p  "Iya, kenapa emangnya... Ada masalah?"

# game/week7.rpy:218
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_34e58017:

    # trida "I mean, instead of going out for actual fresh air or hanging out with anyone else like your usual?"
    trida  "Maksudku, daripada keluar cari angin segar atau nongkrong bareng yang lain kayak biasanya?"

# game/week7.rpy:219
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_ffcdacef:

    # n "You heard their voice lose some of its theatrical bounce and genuine warmth."
    n  "Kamu mendengar nada suaranya kehilangan sedikit sifat teatrikalnya, digantikan kehangatan yang begitu tulus."

# game/week7.rpy:220
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_aacf465e:

    # trida "You didn't have to stay just for me, you know. I'm totally fine."
    trida  "Kamu nggak perlu maksain nemenin aku di sini kalau nggak mau lho. Aku beneran nggak apa-apa kok."

# game/week7.rpy:222
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_14a0666e:

    # p "I was just trying to keep you company so you don't accidentally fold your sketchpad in half out of panic."
    p  "Aku cuma mau nemenin kamu aja biar kamu nggak panik terus nggak sengaja ngebelah buku sketsamu jadi dua."

# game/week7.rpy:223
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_a861f773:

    # n "You replied with a smirk tugging as you saw Trida let out a flustered laugh affectionately."
    n  "Sahutmu dengan seringai tipis, melihat Trida tertawa tersipu penuh rasa hangat."

# game/week7.rpy:224
translate indonesian week7_stay_trida_9778c7fe:

    # trida "Jeez, you're impossible. Yeah, I'm glad you're here."
    trida  "Dasar, ada-ada aja kelakuanmu. Tapi... iya, aku seneng banget kamu ada di sini."

# game/week7.rpy:238
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_7108e326:

    # n "The classroom is bathed in the warm, golden glow of the afternoon sunlight, which streams through the towering windows and creates a dramatic interplay of light and shadow."
    n  "Ruang kelas bermandikan hangatnya semburat keemasan mentari sore yang menerobos melalui jendela-jendela tinggi, menciptakan siluet kontras antara terang dan bayangan."

# game/week7.rpy:239
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_ed762b96:

    # n "The tall shadows stretch languidly across the floor, juxtaposing the neat rows of bulky drawing tablets that have been momentarily set aside."
    n  "Bayangan-bayangan panjang merayap malas di atas lantai, berdampingan dengan deretan drawing tablet tebal yang untuk sementara waktu disingkirkan ke pinggir meja."

# game/week7.rpy:240
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_92c24681:

    # n "In their place, vibrant notebooks and well-worn textbooks are spread out across the desks, hinting at a bustling environment where creativity intertwines with academic pursuit."
    n  "Sebagai gantinya, buku-buku catatan warna-warni dan buku paket tebal yang telah lusuh terhampar di atas meja, menandakan ruang tempat kreativitas berpadu dengan tuntutan akademis."

# game/week7.rpy:242
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_c43e28b0:

    # n "The civics teacher walked in front of the class, her black shoes squeaking softly against the linoleum floor as she dropped a handful of reference handouts onto the front desk."
    n  "Guru PPKn melangkah ke depan kelas, sepatu pantofel hitamnya berderit pelan di atas lantai linoleum saat ia meletakkan setumpuk lembar panduan ke meja guru."

# game/week7.rpy:244
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_25c5f5ba:

    # civics_teacher "Quiet down, please. For today's assignment, you don't need the computers. Just open your textbook to the chapter on the 1945 Constitution."
    civics_teacher  "Tolong tenang semuanya. Untuk tugas hari ini, kalian tidak perlu menyalakan komputer. Cukup buka buku paket kalian pada bab Undang-Undang Dasar 1945."

# game/week7.rpy:245
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_9837e7a8:

    # civics_teacher "Your task is simple: look at the group task, circle the instructions, and coordinate with your group to either answer the exercise questions, draft a short paper, or summarise the material. Get to work."
    civics_teacher  "Instruksinya sederhana: perhatikan tugas kelompok, lingkari bagian instruksinya, lalu koordinasikan dengan kelompok kalian untuk memilih menjawab soal latihan, menyusun makalah singkat, atau meringkas materi. Silakan mulai."

# game/week7.rpy:248
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_7bb6d4ee:

    # n "With a sharp click of her pen, she turned back to the whiteboard to write down the page numbers."
    n  "Dengan bunyi klik pulpen yang tegas, beliau berbalik ke papan tulis untuk menuliskan nomor halaman tugas."

# game/week7.rpy:249
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_8f494da4:

    # n "Around the room, the sound of chairs scraping against the worn floor echoed as students pulled out sheets of loose-leaf paper and began rifling through their textbooks."
    n  "Di sekeliling ruangan, bunyi derit kursi yang bergesekan dengan lantai terdengar saat para siswa mulai mengeluarkan kertas folio dan membuka buku paket mereka."

# game/week7.rpy:250
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_818a6605:

    # n "Yet, at your cluster of desks, a sense of tension hung in the air, palpable and suffocating."
    n  "Namun, di meja kelompokmu, hawa ketegangan mendadak menggantung pekat dan menyesakkan di udara."

# game/week7.rpy:252
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_a884459d:

    # n "The boy seated directly across from you—typically so inconspicuous that he practically faded into the background of the classroom—exhaled a heavy, deliberate sigh that seemed to slice through the ambient noise."
    n  "Siswa laki-laki yang duduk tepat di hadapanmu—sosok pendiam yang biasanya begitu samar hingga nyaris tak kasat mata di kelas—menghembuskan napas panjang yang terdengar berat dan menusuk keheningan."

# game/week7.rpy:253
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_f7208e78:

    # n "With an air of practiced detachment, as if viewing group work merely as an unwelcome administrative chore rather than an opportunity for collaboration, he snapped open his hefty civics textbook with a dull thwack."
    n  "Dengan pembawaan dingin yang tampak begitu terbiasa, seolah menganggap kerja kelompok ini murni beban administratif yang menyebalkan ketimbang wadah kolaborasi, ia membuka buku PPKn-nya yang tebal dengan bunyi debuk hampa."

# game/week7.rpy:256
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_5549fa4d:

    # n "His gaze remained fixed on the pages before him, avoiding eye contact as he methodically adjusted his glasses."
    n  "Pandangannya terpaku lurus pada lembaran buku di depannya, sengaja menghindari kontak mata seraya membetulkan letak kacamata dengan gerakan teratur."

# game/week7.rpy:257
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_c3528d71:

    # n "With a stillness that suggested he was accustomed to being overlooked, he turned straight to the assigned page without a single word escaping his lips."
    n  "Dengan ketenangan khas orang yang sudah terbiasa diabaikan, ia langsung membuka halaman yang ditugaskan tanpa sepatah kata pun keluar dari bibirnya."

# game/week7.rpy:260
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_f059b71b:

    # n "Beside him, Trida sat frozen."
    n  "Di sampingnya, Trida duduk membeku kaku."

# game/week7.rpy:261
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_b713243b:

    # n "They stared down at their textbook, but their eyes were completely glazed over, not registering a single word of the printed text."
    n  "Ia menatap nanar ke arah buku paketnya, namun pandangan matanya tampak kosong melompong, tak sanggup mencerna satu kata pun dari deretan teks yang tercetak di sana."

# game/week7.rpy:262
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_cb8e08a5:

    # n "Their fingers were locked tightly together in their lap, trembling slightly as their gaze darted anxiously around the desk, refusing to meet anyone's eyes."
    n  "Kedua tangannya terkunci rapat di pangkuan, sedikit gemetar saat tatapannya melirik cemas ke sudut-sudut meja, enggan bertatapan dengan siapa pun."

# game/week7.rpy:264
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_0b9dd651:

    # n "Without waiting for either of you to take the lead, Trida reached out a hesitant, shaking hand to flip to the correct page in their own book, completely bypassing the instruction to circle the prompt first."
    n  "Tanpa menunggu kalian berdua mengambil inisiatif, tangan Trida yang gemetar terulur ragu untuk membuka halaman yang sama di bukunya, melewatkan perintah guru untuk melingkari instruksi terlebih dahulu."

# game/week7.rpy:265
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_a39b2671:

    # n "They rushed to grab a pencil, their hand moving too fast out of pure panic, and accidentally knocked their eraser off the desk."
    n  "Ia terburu-buru meraih pensil, gerakannya terlalu panik dan tergesa-gesa, hingga tanpa sengaja menyenggol penghapusnya jatuh dari meja."

# game/week7.rpy:266
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_12c2caf4:

    # n "It bounced off your shoe with a soft thud."
    n  "Penghapus itu memantul pelan mengenai sepatumu sebelum mendarat di lantai."

# game/week7.rpy:268
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_d2df0c4f:

    # n "The boy didn't even look up from his page. His expression remained entirely flat, devoid of any emotional spike, as he delivered a deadpan critique with the casual detachment of an automated system reading a prompt."
    n  "Cowok berkacamata itu bahkan tidak repot-repot mengangkat kepalanya dari buku. Raut wajahnya tetap datar tanpa ekspresi emosi sedikit pun, melontarkan kritik dingin dengan nada datar bagai sistem otomatis yang membaca prompt teks."

# game/week7.rpy:269
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_0fe0a5f2:

    # glasses_boy "You dropped it. And you skipped the circle instruction. It's not that complicated."
    glasses_boy  "Penghapusmu jatuh. Dan kamu lupa ngelingkari instruksinya. Padahal instruksi gampang gitu doang."

# game/week7.rpy:272
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_e83efea3:

    # n "Trida's hand froze mid-air above the floor. The tips of their ears turned into a mortified shade of red, and they pulled their arm back in an instant, resting it limply against their knee."
    n  "Tangan Trida membeku di udara tepat di atas lantai. Ujung daun telinganya seketika berubah merah padam karena malu bukan kepalang, dan ia langsung menarik tangannya kembali, membiarkannya terkulai lemas di atas lutut."

# game/week7.rpy:273
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_28fb206a:

    # n "Trida didn't bend down to pick up the eraser. The only thing they did was stare blankly at the crease of the book, biting their lower lip until it turned white."
    n  "Trida tidak membungkuk untuk memungut penghapusnya. Yang bisa ia lakukan hanyalah menatap hampa lipatan tengah buku paketnya, menggigit bibir bawahnya rapat-rapat hingga memutih."

# game/week7.rpy:274
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_03e9bc4c:

    # n "All of their worst, deep-seated fears—the ones they always tried to mask behind loud banter or constant jokes—were completely exposed by the uninterested dismissiveness of their groupmate."
    n  "Segala ketakutan terbesarnya yang selama ini ia kubur rapat-rapat di balik lelucon konyol dan tawa riang—kini terkoyak telanjang bulat oleh ketidakpedulian dingin dari teman sekelompoknya sendiri."

# game/week7.rpy:275
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_d8e141ed:

    # n "Trida couldn't even force a laugh, completely unable to find words to defend themself."
    n  "Trida bahkan tak mampu memaksakan tawa kecil, lidahnya kelu tak sanggup merangkai sepatah kata pun untuk membela diri."

# game/week7.rpy:277
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_3b1cf595:

    # n "The boy turned the page of his textbook with a quiet rustle of paper, entirely unbothered by the sudden vacuum of air at the table."
    n  "Cowok itu membalik halaman bukunya dengan bunyi gesekan kertas yang pelan, sama sekali tidak terganggu oleh atmosfer membeku yang tiba-tiba melanda meja itu."

# game/week7.rpy:278
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_ffb0be7a:

    # glasses_boy "Anyway. We have to pick between answering the questions or writing the summary. I'm just going to write the summary so we can leave early. Let me know if you guys are doing something else, or if you're just going to sit there."
    glasses_boy  "Terserah deh. Kita harus milih mau ngejawab soal atau bikin ringkasan materi. Aku mau ngerjain ringkasan aja biar bisa pulang cepet. Kasih tahu aja kalau kalian mau ngerjain yang lain, atau kalau kalian emang cuma mau bengong doang di situ."

# game/week7.rpy:280
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_204e87e6:

    # n "His voice carried no malice, which somehow made it infinitely worse."
    n  "Suaranya tidak terdengar memusuhi, namun justru hal itulah yang membuatnya terasa berkali-kali lipat lebih menyakitkan."

# game/week7.rpy:281
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_c57a4e40:

    # n "It was the absolute, crushing indifference of someone treating Trida not even as a frustrating obstacle, but as a mildly inconvenient system error to be bypassed."
    n  "Itu adalah sikap acuh tak acuh yang menghancurkan dari seseorang yang bahkan tidak menganggap Trida sebagai rintangan yang menjengkelkan, melainkan sekadar sistem eror kecil yang cukup dilewati begitu saja."

# game/week7.rpy:283
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_39c9f98c:

    # n "You sat right beside Trida, and suddenly a rush of hesitation climbed up from your throat."
    n  "Kamu duduk tepat di samping Trida, dan rasa gamang yang menusuk tiba-tiba merambat naik menyumbat tenggorokanmu."

# game/week7.rpy:284
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_6d6ce14e:

    # n "You had spent so long being their friend, and suddenly the absolute devastation written across Trida's usually expressive face made a heavy knot form in your chest."
    n  "Sudah begitu lama kamu menjadi temannya, dan melihat hancurnya raut wajah Trida yang biasanya begitu ceria seketika membuat gumpalan sesak menyesakkan rongga dadamu."

# game/week7.rpy:285
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_86db89b7:

    # n "You had never seen Trida look completely hollowed out and defeated, reduced to silence by someone who didn't even care enough to be angry."
    n  "Kamu belum pernah melihat Trida sehancur dan seputus asa ini, terbungkam mati kutu oleh seseorang yang bahkan tidak peduli untuk sekadar marah padanya."

# game/week7.rpy:287
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_f41d2e34:

    # n "Trida stared down at the open page, their throat working as if trying to swallow glass."
    n  "Trida menatap nanar halaman terbuka itu, tenggorokannya bergerak menelan ludah seolah sedang menelan pecahan kaca tajam."

# game/week7.rpy:288
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_26cf5e01:

    # n "The crushing weight of feeling entirely useless—of being viewed with mechanical disregard—finally forced a fractured, defensive murmur past their lips."
    n  "Beban telak dari perasaan bahwa dirinya benar-benar tidak berguna—diperlakukan bagai mesin yang rusak—akhirnya memaksa sebuah gumaman lirih yang rapuh lolos dari bibirnya."

# game/week7.rpy:289
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_2a24fc47:

    # trida "I... I was going to circle it..."
    trida  "A—aku tadi mau ngelingkari kok..."

# game/week7.rpy:290
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_4ea81fb3:

    # n "Trida whispered with a voice cracking slightly, so quiet it was almost swallowed by the ambient noise of the classroom."
    n  "Trida berbisik dengan suara yang sedikit bergetar parau, begitu lirih hingga nyaris ditelan bisingnya suara kelas."

# game/week7.rpy:291
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_bc9fb81a:

    # n "They stared down at their desk, fingers clutching the edges of their textbook like a lifeline, desperately trying to excuse the panic."
    n  "Ia terus menunduk menatap mejanya, jemarinya mencengkeram erat pinggiran buku paket bagai tali penyelamat, mati-matian berusaha mencari pembenaran atas kepanikannya."

# game/week7.rpy:292
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_e01c8062:

    # trida "I just... I was rushing. I can still do it. I'm not... I'm not trying to mess it up on purpose."
    trida  "Aku cuma... lagi buru-buru tadi. Aku masih bisa ngerjainnya kok. Aku... aku nggak sengaja bikin kacau..."

# game/week7.rpy:294
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_10f868f5:

    # n "The boy didn't look up from his textbook, letting out a sharp, dismissive sigh through his nose as he tapped his pen against the margin."
    n  "Cowok berkacamata itu tak bergeming dari bukunya, hanya menghembuskan napas panjang yang mencemooh lewat hidungnya seraya mengetuk-ngetukkan pulpen di pinggir halaman."

# game/week7.rpy:295
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_43cba5c0:

    # glasses_boy "Well, whatever, it doesn't matter, let's just get this over with."
    glasses_boy  "Ya udahlah, nggak penting juga, buruan kelarin aja biar cepet selesai."

# game/week7.rpy:298
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_15dd74ee:

    # n "The flatness of his tone carried a sharp edge of annoyance, dropping like another lead weight over the small cluster of desks."
    n  "Datar nada suaranya menyisakan sengatan rasa jengkel yang tajam, jatuh bagai beban timah berat di atas meja kelompok kalian."

# game/week7.rpy:299
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_9d6b8a74:

    # n "Instantly, any lingering sound from their corner completely vanished. The silence that followed was an absolute, suffocating awkward tension that made the air feel thin."
    n  "Seketika itu juga, sisa-sisa suara di sudut mejamu lenyap tak berbekas. Keheningan yang menyusul terasa begitu canggung, menyesakkan, dan membuat udara serasa menipis."

# game/week7.rpy:301
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_28342f88:

    # n "Trida recoiled sharply as if they had received a physical blow. All of their usual chatter and restless energy seemed to vanish completely."
    n  "Trida tersentak mundur seolah baru saja dihantam pukulan fisik yang keras. Segala ocehan ceria dan energi lincahnya yang biasa sirna tak berbekas."

# game/week7.rpy:302
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_c3ffb3ba:

    # n "They could only gaze downward in embarrassment, their eyes stinging and a trembling hand grasping the pencil in an attempt to continue working."
    n  "Ia hanya bisa menunduk menahan malu, matanya perih memanas dan tangannya yang gemetar berusaha memegang pensil untuk kembali bekerja."

# game/week7.rpy:303
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_c4f0b4c3:

    # n "They drew a haphazard circle around the instructions, but their fingers wouldn't steady, and their mind was utterly blank."
    n  "Ia membuat lingkaran asal-asalan di sekitar kalimat instruksi, namun jemarinya tak kunjung tenang, dan isi kepalanya benar-benar kosong melompong."

# game/week7.rpy:304
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_f349847a:

    # n "The text on the page blended into a jumble of meaningless ink, and each awkward mark only served to validate the boy's assertion."
    n  "Deretan teks di halaman buku melebur menjadi gumpalan tinta yang tak bermakna, dan setiap goresan tangannya yang kikuk seakan membenarkan ucapan dingin cowok tadi."

# game/week7.rpy:305
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_e9f8048c:

    # n "They ceased their efforts, allowing their hand to fall into their lap, shoulders fully slumped."
    n  "Ia akhirnya menyerah, membiarkan tangannya jatuh lunglai ke pangkuan dengan pundak yang merosot lesu."

# game/week7.rpy:307
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_4f0b33d6:

    # n "You stood frozen beside them, a tight knot of unease twisting in your chest."
    n  "Kamu terdiam kaku di sampingnya, gumpalan rasa resah dan getir melilit erat di dalam dadamu."

# game/week7.rpy:308
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_30f28d34:

    # n "After all the hours you'd spent mingling with their mood swings, offering a steady presence through their emotional storms, you had never seen Trida like this."
    n  "Setelah berjam-jam kamu menemani pasang surut emosinya, menjadi tempatnya bersandar melewati badai perasaannya, kamu belum pernah melihat Trida seterpuruk ini."

# game/week7.rpy:309
translate indonesian week7_civics_assignment_2303873d:

    # n "They were utterly spent, their defenses stripped away, the weight of their turmoil spilling over as they quietly crumbled next to you."
    n  "Ia benar-benar hancur, seluruh pertahanan dirinya terkoyak habis; beban kepedihan hatinya tumpah ruah saat ia diam-diam runtuh tepat di sebelahmu."

# game/week7.rpy:324
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_f8d3c444:

    # p "Are you okay?"
    p  "Kamu nggak apa-apa?"

# game/week7.rpy:326
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_1f6d844a:

    # n "Trida didn't look up when you spoke."
    n  "Trida tidak mendongak saat kamu memanggilnya."

# game/week7.rpy:327
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_969374d8:

    # n "For a long, agonizing second, the only movement was the faint, rapid twitch of their fingers where they were balled into tight fists in their lap."
    n  "Untuk beberapa detik yang terasa begitu menyiksa, satu-satunya tanda kehidupan hanyalah kedutan halus jemarinya yang mengepal erat di pangkuannya."

# game/week7.rpy:328
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_b3d1d0f5:

    # n "When they finally raised their head slightly, their eyes were glossy, avoiding your gaze entirely as they fixed on a scuff mark on the wooden desk."
    n  "Ketika ia akhirnya mengangkat kepalanya sedikit, kedua matanya tampak berkaca-kaca menahan tangis, sengaja menghindari tatapanmu dan terpaku pada goresan noda di meja kayu."

# game/week7.rpy:330
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_3e09ab62:

    # trida "I'm... yeah. I'm fine,"
    trida  "Aku... iya. Aku nggak apa-apa kok,"

# game/week7.rpy:331
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_1ef7a40b:

    # n "Trida whispered back with that strained voice that seemed entirely unconvincing."
    n  "Trida membalas lirih dengan suara tercekat yang sama sekali tidak meyakinkan."

# game/week7.rpy:332
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_58494530:

    # n "They managed a weak, pathetic ghost of a smile that didn't reach their eyes at all before giving a subtle shake of their head."
    n  "Ia memaksakan seulas senyum getir yang begitu rapuh dan tak sampai ke matanya, sebelum menggelengkan kepalanya samar."

# game/week7.rpy:333
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_1d09dc26:

    # trida "Just... don't worry about it right now. We need to finish this before the bell. Let's just... let's just get it done."
    trida  "Udah... nggak usah dipikirin sekarang ya. Kita harus kelarin ini sebelum bel bunyi. Ayo kita... kita selesaikan tugasnya."

# game/week7.rpy:335
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_b3ee1289:

    # n "You saw Trida's hands pick up their pencil again, their knuckles turning white from how hard they were gripping, and forced those tangerine eyes to stare back down at the blank lines of the paper."
    n  "Kamu melihat tangan Trida memungut kembali pensilnya, buku-buku jarinya memutih saking eratnya menggenggam, dan ia memaksa sepasang mata oranyenya menatap kembali garis-garis kosong di kertas."

# game/week7.rpy:336
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_2d5785d8:

    # n "But you could see right through the fragile facade."
    n  "Namun kamu bisa membaca topeng kerapuhan itu dengan jelas."

# game/week7.rpy:337
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_a20d1566:

    # n "You knew they weren't working, because Trida was just holding themself together by a thread, terrified that if they moved or spoke another word, they would completely shatter in front of everyone."
    n  "Kamu tahu betul ia sedang tidak bisa berpikir jernih untuk mengerjakan tugas; Trida hanya sedang mati-matian menahan diri agar tidak runtuh, takut jika ia bergerak atau berbicara sepatah kata lagi, ia akan benar-benar pecah menangis di depan semua orang."

# game/week7.rpy:338
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_e3f037e6:

    # n "Sitting right beside them, a profound wave of helplessness washed over you."
    n  "Duduk tepat di sampingnya, gelombang rasa tak berdaya yang begitu dalam menyapu hatimu."

# game/week7.rpy:339
translate indonesian week7_reassure_okay_f5ade495:

    # n "You wanted to fix it, to push past their defenses and chase away the humiliation suffocating them, but watching them retreat into such a defensive shell left you wondering how you could reach them."
    n  "Kamu ingin memperbaiki keadaan, meruntuhkan tembok pertahanannya dan mengusir rasa malu yang mencekiknya, namun melihatnya meringkuk ke dalam cangkang pelindungnya membuatmu bingung bagaimana cara menggapainya."

# game/week7.rpy:345
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_07cbe7f7:

    # p "What did you just do?"
    p  "Kamu barusan ngapain?"

# game/week7.rpy:347
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_e79558aa:

    # n "Trida didn't react right away."
    n  "Trida tidak langsung merespons."

# game/week7.rpy:348
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_47b2d979:

    # n "They became completely still, the pencil awkwardly suspended above the blank page like a pendulum caught at the height of its swing."
    n  "Ia mendadak mematung kaku, pensil di tangannya melayang kikuk di atas kertas kosong bagai bandul jam yang tertahan di titik tertinggi ayunannya."

# game/week7.rpy:349
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_01b67ca4:

    # n "The familiar nervous chatter that usually filled the space had vanished."
    n  "Celotehan cemas yang biasanya selalu mengisi ruang seketika lenyap tak bersisa."

# game/week7.rpy:350
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_a516dbc8:

    # n "Instead, Trida sat with an intense tension radiating from them, their jaw clenched, and brow furrowed in a deep, conflicted frown that hinted at a storm of thoughts swirling just beneath the surface."
    n  "Sebaliknya, ketegangan yang pekat memancar dari tubuhnya; rahangnya mengatup rapat, dan dahinya berkerut dalam menunjukkan pergulatan batin yang berkecamuk hebat di dalam kepalanya."

# game/week7.rpy:352
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_d88eb2b0:

    # n "When they finally stirred, it was not to meet your gaze."
    n  "Saat ia akhirnya bergerak, gerakannya bukan untuk menatap wajahmu."

# game/week7.rpy:353
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_4740432f:

    # n "Trida's eyes flitted nervously away, avoiding yours with a desperate flicker toward the window, then darting downward to the desk as if the very surface could provide an escape from the pressure of your scrutiny."
    n  "Sepasang mata Trida bergeser cemas menghindar, melirik panik ke arah jendela luar lalu buru-buru menunduk menatap meja seolah permukaan kayu itu bisa memberinya jalan keluar dari tatapanmu."

# game/week7.rpy:354
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_3fb40bcc:

    # n "They swallowed hard, the movement of their throat betraying the struggle within, and their fingers gripped the fabric of their uniform pants so tightly that the knuckles turned white."
    n  "Ia menelan ludah dengan susah payah, gerakan di lehernya memperlihatkan kepedihan yang ia tahan, dan jemarinya mencengkeram kuat kain celana seragamnya hingga buku-buku jarinya memutih."

# game/week7.rpy:355
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_78f8a645:

    # n "A heavy silence enveloped you both, and the stillness stretched on, morphing into an uncomfortable tension that seeped into your own mind, amplifying the weight of unspoken words between you."
    n  "Keheningan pekat menyelimuti kalian berdua, waktu terasa merayap lambat dan berubah menjadi ketegangan canggung yang merayap ke pikiranmu sendiri, memperberat beban kata-kata yang tak terucap."

# game/week7.rpy:359
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_82e01811:

    # p "Did I say the wrong thing..."
    p  "Apa aku salah ngomong ya..."

# game/week7.rpy:361
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_fdf4cb49:

    # p "Was asking 'what did you just do' too aggressive?"
    p  "Apa nanya 'kamu barusan ngapain' tadi kedengeran terlalu galak?"

# game/week7.rpy:363
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_024fd207:

    # p "Did I sound too interrogating?"
    p  "Apa aku kedengeran kayak lagi nginterogasi?"

# game/week7.rpy:365
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_3401a6b7:

    # n "Every second that stretched on without a response felt deafening."
    n  "Tiap detik yang berlalu tanpa sepatah kata jawaban terasa begitu memekakkan telinga."

# game/week7.rpy:366
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_756c31ac:

    # n "You found yourself second-guessing your own tone, wondering if you had just made an already fragile moment ten times worse."
    n  "Kamu mulai meragukan nada bicaramu sendiri, cemas jangan-jangan kamu baru saja membuat situasi yang sudah rapuh ini menjadi sepuluh kali lebih buruk."

# game/week7.rpy:367
translate indonesian week7_reassure_interrogate_1e9bca01:

    # n "Trida kept their head down, wrapped in their own quiet misery, leaving you sitting there in overthought silence."
    n  "Trida tetap menundukkan kepalanya, tenggelam dalam kepedihan hatinya sendiri, meninggalkanmu terdiam dalam pusaran overthinking."

# game/week7.rpy:373
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_7cff3974:

    # n "When you chose to remain silent, an oppressive stillness enveloped the desk, settling heavily like an unwelcome blanket that stifled any remaining whispers of conversation."
    n  "Saat kamu memilih untuk tetap diam, keheningan yang menindih menyelimuti meja kalian, jatuh bagai selimut tebal yang membungkam sisa-sisa bisikan obrolan."

# game/week7.rpy:374
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_df2b8153:

    # n "Trida released a shaky breath that seemed to escape their lips."
    n  "Trida menghembuskan napas gemetar yang lolos tertahan dari bibirnya."

# game/week7.rpy:375
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_e1bf27e6:

    # n "As the realization of your lack of response sank in, they slowly turned their attention back to the open textbook before them, their red-rimmed eyes stubbornly fixed on the dense paper as if it held all the answers."
    n  "Menyadari ketiadaan respons darimu, ia perlahan mengalihkan kembali perhatiannya ke buku paket yang terbuka di hadapannya, matanya yang memerah menatap nanar deretan kertas tebal itu seakan mencari jawaban hidup di sana."

# game/week7.rpy:377
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_92acd36a:

    # n "They attempted to work once more, but each motion felt agonizingly slow and laborious."
    n  "Ia berusaha kembali mengerjakan tugas, namun tiap gerakannya terasa begitu lambat dan menyiksa."

# game/week7.rpy:378
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_4925a7cb:

    # n "Every movement of their hand was filled with hesitance and stiffness."
    n  "Setiap goresan tangannya dipenuhi keraguan dan kekakuan yang nyata."

# game/week7.rpy:379
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_efaf09a6:

    # n "They would laboriously write down a solitary sentence, then stare at it, lost in thought for what felt like an eternity."
    n  "Ia bersusah payah menuliskan sebaris kalimat, lalu terpaku menatapnya, melamun dalam waktu yang terasa bagai keabadian."

# game/week7.rpy:380
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_311afb5d:

    # n "After a long moment, they would erase half of it, their fingers trembling as they rewrote it, as if any imperfection could provoke yet another comment."
    n  "Setelah jeda panjang, ia menghapus setengah tulisannya; jemarinya bergetar saat menulis ulang, seakan takut goresan yang tak sempurna akan memicu komentar pedas lainnya."

# game/week7.rpy:381
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_e633752f:

    # n "Their shoulders remained tightly clenched, hunched inward as if trying to shield themselves from the stark scrutiny of the surrounding room."
    n  "Bahunya tetap menegang rapat, membungkuk ke dalam seakan berusaha melindungi dirinya dari tatapan orang-orang di ruangan itu."

# game/week7.rpy:383
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_b21d9d71:

    # n "Beside them, you watched the painful, exhausting effort they put into just stringing together a few words."
    n  "Di sampingnya, kamu menyaksikan perjuangan pedih dan melelahkan yang ia curahkan hanya demi merangkai beberapa patah kata."

# game/week7.rpy:384
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_d6ab4008:

    # n "A part of you ached to say something, to lift the crushing weight of humiliation that pressed down upon them, but the prospect of speaking felt dangerous—like it might shatter the delicate control Trida was clinging to with everything they had."
    n  "Sebagian hatimu terenyuh ingin mengatakan sesuatu, mengangkat beban rasa malu yang menindihnya, namun berbicara terasa begitu berbahaya—seolah bisa menghancurkan sisa-sisa kendali diri yang sedang dipertahankan Trida mati-matian."

# game/week7.rpy:385
translate indonesian week7_reassure_silent_abe53046:

    # n "So you end up just sending support through silently, an unspoken prayer of your heart wishing to be accepted through telepathic warmth to Trida."
    n  "Maka pada akhirnya kamu hanya bisa mengirimkan dukungan dalam diam, doa tulus dari lubuk hatimu yang berharap bisa tersampaikan lewat kehangatan batin kepada Trida."

# game/week7.rpy:390
translate indonesian week7_conclusion_ae19f3ce:

    # n "The painful quiet at the desk continues until the school bell finally cuts through the room."
    n  "Keheningan yang menyakitkan di meja itu terus bertahan hingga bel pulang sekolah akhirnya berdering memecah suasana kelas."

# game/week7.rpy:394
translate indonesian week7_conclusion_26a61839:

    # n "Without a single word, Trida sweeps their books into their bag, keeping their eyes glued to the floor as they slip quickly out the door."
    n  "Tanpa mengucap sepatah kata pun, Trida langsung menyapu buku-bukunya masuk ke dalam tas, tatapannya tetap terpaku ke lantai saat ia melangkah cepat keluar dari pintu kelas."

# game/week7.rpy:395
translate indonesian week7_conclusion_3d56ac0c:

    # n "You stand alone by your desk, a heavy ache lingering in your chest."
    n  "Kamu berdiri sendirian di samping mejamu, rasa sesak yang berat masih membekas mengganjal di dadamu."

# game/week7.rpy:396
translate indonesian week7_conclusion_44e0ed82:

    # n "You know you cannot leave things like this..."
    n  "Kamu tahu betul bahwa kamu tidak bisa membiarkan masalah ini menggantung begitu saja..."

